Package: rkwifibt-dev-tools
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rockchip wifi/BT attach tools + AIC8800 wifi/bt init service
 BT attach tools (brcm_patchram_plus1, dhd_priv, rtk_hciattach, rk_hciattach)
 plus the wifibt-init.service, scripts and conf that bring up the on-board
 AIC8800D80 wifi/bt. Kernel modules and firmware are provided separately by
 the BSP image.
